[h1]New Features:[/h1]
[list]
[*]Coin collection along the maze;
[*]Unlocking skins and abilities such as: more powerful flashlights; more lives, so you have new chances to finish a maze without having to catch all the kittens again;
[*]New user interface, friendlier and prettier;
[/list]

[h1]Halloween-inspired content:[/h1]
[list]
[*]Exclusive music to bring a darker mood;
[*]Themed decor in the setting;
[*][COMING SOON] New costume skins;
[/list]

[h1]Bug fixes and other issues:[/h1]
[list]
[*]Adjust in the direction of the flashlight so that it keeps pointing in the direction even after the character stops walking;
[*]Calibration of the character's movement to make it less susceptible to falling.
[/list]
